  "StockRole": "Brawler",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Lindworm is the Society's replacement for the Basilisk Quad, which they couldn't get parts for anymore. They built it from scratch around components they make themselves and doubled the weight, but most of that extra weight went into keeping it just as fast and adding armor. It runs Electric Discharge ProtoMech Armor, which is tough, but its weight and energy demands make the Lindworm a poor fit for energy weapons.",
